{"agent": {"state": {"session_id": "1788879883000-9f9175", "summary": "", "context": [{"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "新买的激光切割机下周到货，帮我列验收清单。", "id": "fd992147574348aa871cce42c53387f6", "created_at": "2026-09-08T15:04:43", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "b5af4200c2f0404097aef95ec297124a", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-08T15:04:43", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "结合公司制度与实际业务场景，给出可执行的答复。", "id": "f017121c6ce84980ab80b9b068464692", "created_at": "2026-09-08T15:04:51", "finished_at": "2026-09-08T15:05:33"}, {"type": "text", "text": "**新设备验收清单**\n1. 开箱：外观无损、随机附件与装箱单一致\n2. 铭牌参数与合同一致（功率/行程/精度等级）\n3. 安装调平后精度复检：定位精度、重复定位精度\n4. 满负荷试机 2 小时：无异常发热/异响\n5. 随机资料：说明书/合格证/电气图/保修卡\n6. 操作培训完成并签字\n全部通过再签验收单，问题项写明整改期限。", "id": "38ff1f0015c54ff2a706b36c4968b6b1", "created_at": "2026-09-08T15:04:51", "finished_at": "2026-09-08T15:05:33"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "b4adab1980ad45a98b13cf77bf720c52", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-08T15:04:51", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-09-08T15:05:33", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "精度复检找谁做？", "id": "89820b5fcde4455bb53f4ee8986bcb23", "created_at": "2026-09-08T15:06:43", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "b50c648bd5254a5d85f1fe94a117a6c4", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-08T15:06:43", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "结合公司制度与实际业务场景，给出可执行的答复。", "id": "7c05e23b64b2423e90a897ead71bcdc3", "created_at": "2026-09-08T15:06:51", "finished_at": "2026-09-08T15:07:33"}, {"type": "text", "text": "两档：厂方调试验收时用 their 标准件现场做一遍（免费）；关键精度建议另请第三方计量所出报告（约 2000 元），作为日后质保争议的依据。", "id": "b35492fb00db4c9d91264a2bf8f0a214", "created_at": "2026-09-08T15:06:51", "finished_at": "2026-09-08T15:07:33"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "07531eac4bac4128be92656b26021bfd", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-08T15:06:51", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-09-08T15:07:33", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "验收单谁来签？", "id": "c365b4019fcd452e947d608e02c54445", "created_at": "2026-09-08T15:08:33", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "61b2f5f534b94f988704715801664f74", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-08T15:08:33", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "结合公司制度与实际业务场景，给出可执行的答复。", "id": "e3ba5485d7944fdc90c23fc0427f3b05", "created_at": "2026-09-08T15:08:39", "finished_at": "2026-09-08T15:09:13"}, {"type": "text", "text": "设备员+生产主管+供货方三方现场签；金额超 10 万的加财务资产口径签认。验收单原件财务入固定资产账，复印件随机档案存车间。", "id": "57bb257137af4cc5b602b2259d772942", "created_at": "2026-09-08T15:08:39", "finished_at": "2026-09-08T15:09:13"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "3c0e08b17ee14d2c99c1a3fe8141a593", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-08T15:08:39", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-09-08T15:09:13", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}], "reply_context": {}, "permission_context": {}, "tool_context": {}, "tasks_context": {}, "middle_context": {}}}}